ic\">Are there \u2026 ?</span> to make a question.<br/><br/>You use expressions like <span class = \"italic\">left, right, straight ahead, across from</span> or <span class = \"italic\">next to</span> to say where things are.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Answer\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is there + singular noun?<br/>Are there + plural noun?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes, it is ... / No, there isn't.<br/>Yes, there are ... / No, there aren't.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: Is there a library in the neighborhood?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes. It is straight ahead, across from the park.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Are there many restaurants in your neighborhood?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, there are some next to the swimming pool.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Prepositions of Place", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the following prepositions of place and expressions to talk about places in a neighborhood or city.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"7\",\"columns\":\"3\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Preposition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Description</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"right\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Turning to the direction of your right hand\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The park is on the right.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"left\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Turning to the direction of your left hand\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The park is on the left.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"straight ahead\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Going straight in front of you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The stadium is straight ahead.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"next to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Beside you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The bakery is next to the restaurant.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"near\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Close to you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The bakery is near the restaurant.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"across from\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Opposite from you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The restaurant is across from the park.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "across from", "type": "name"}, {"content": "opposite; on the other side of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(preposition)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a park across from the stadium.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le06ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"conte